# Platform-managed agentplat state, not project source. In the
# client-initiated single-repo workspace layout (make's `Path: "."` spec) the
# repo root IS the workspace root, so these land inside this repo rather than
# beside it.
/.plugins/
/.opencode-skills/

# Freebuff agent state: downloaded headless browsers, browser profiles
# (their cache files are exclusively locked by live browser processes, so
# git add fails on them), logs and scratch dirs. Never project source.
/.freebuff/
